5. NO SECURITY BOUNDARY

The Software includes masking and redaction features intended to keep sensitive
values off your screen and out of exported files. These are display and export
hygiene features. They are NOT a security boundary, NOT an access control, and
NOT a compliance control: the Software receives complete message payloads from
your Kafka brokers, and masking is applied only at the point of display or
export. You are responsible for determining whether the Software is appropriate
for use with regulated, confidential, or personal data, and for any controls
required by law or contract.

